## 01. Executive Summary

This report evaluates missing data in the Retail Sales Transactions dataset using Python and Pandas. The analysis identifies incomplete columns, measures overall data completeness, and highlights areas requiring further investigation.

| Dataset Metrics             | Results |
| :-------------------------- | ------: |
| Total Records               |  19,850 |
| Total Columns               |      36 |
| Total Data Cells            | 714,600 |
| Missing Values              |  30,479 |
| Data Completeness           |  95.31% |
| Columns with Missing Values | 10 / 36 |

### Data Completeness Overview

| Data Status    | Percentage |
| :------------- | ---------: |
| Complete Cells |     95.31% |
| Missing Cells  |      4.69% |

